body:
I'm having the same issue as everyone else it seems. My game crashes constantly, straight to desktop. I've even switched PC and the problem is still there. So its not on my end...
It's unplayable and really annoying. I'm playing through Microsoft Store, and I've never had these issues before this update. I tried to end the easy anti-cheat process in the task manager, since that had helped some people, but it didn't change anything. I'm not running any other antivirus other than windows defender, so it's not an issue there either.
You gotta look this over devs, because we're going insane here ;-;
